  user_1,[00:00] Hi Ravi, uh... I got the email about the refund but just wanted to double‑check everything’s settled.
  user_2,[00:05] Hey Reyansh, yes, we processed the cancellation. The $480 prorated refund is on its way.
  user_1,[00:12] Great, um… can you tell me the exact date it’ll hit my account? I need to plan a car purchase.
  user_2,[00:18] Sure, it should post by 10/05/2026. You’ll get an email receipt right after.
  user_1,[00:24] Got it… and just to be safe, there’s no outstanding balance on my account, right?
  user_2,[00:30] Correct, your balance is zero. The policy is now marked as Expired in our system.
  user_1,[00:35] Okay… thanks. One more thing – if I decide to get a new policy later, will I need a new quote or can I reactivate this one?
  user_2,[00:42] You’ll need a fresh quote since the old policy is closed, but we can pull your history to speed it up.
  user_1,[00:48] Alright, that sounds good. I’ll reach out when I’m ready. Thanks for your help.
  user_2,[00:55] You’re welcome! If anything else comes up, just give us a call. Have a great day. [sighs]